    "L020: \"SkuId MUST adhere to the following requirements:\"",
    "  L022: \"SkuId MUST be of type String.\"",
    "  L023: \"SkuId MUST conform to [StringHandling](#attributes.stringhandling) requirements.\"",
    "  L024: \"SkuId MUST NOT be null.\"",
